    <item>
      <title>新罕布什尔州民主党人敲响警钟：“我们正在失败”</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/pappas-sununu-new-hampshire-senate.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[自 2010 年以来，该州还没有选举过共和党参议员。但可能的民主党候选人克里斯·帕帕斯 (Chris Pappas) 预计，与著名对手约翰·E·苏努努 (John E. Sununu) 的竞争将非常激烈。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/pappas-sununu-new-hampshire-senate.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 16:22:43 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>对于被解雇的德桑蒂斯竞选工作人员来说，国务院有第二次机会。</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/nate-hochman-state-dept.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[内特·霍赫曼 (Nate Hochman) 因一段包含纳粹标志的视频引起轩然大波而失去了工作，此次聘用凸显了政府愿意忽视过去的违法行为。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/nate-hochman-state-dept.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 16:22:22 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>将多纳休将军从赫格塞斯的军队清洗中拯救出来的战斗</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/hegseth-army-general-donahue.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[克里斯托弗·T·多纳休将军对未来战争的愿景为他赢得了世界各地的强大支持者。他们能挽救他的职业生涯吗？]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/hegseth-army-general-donahue.html</guid>
