    <item>
      <title>特朗普对邮寄选票的战争让选民感到困惑。这可能就是重点。</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/elections/trump-mail-in-voting-confusion.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[从俄勒冈州到佛罗里达州，官员们立即向选民保证他们的选票是安全的，并鼓励他们使用投递箱或亲自投票。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/elections/trump-mail-in-voting-confusion.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:58:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
